{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2022-03-23 05:52:00', 'title': 'CITI WORKS WITH STENN TO HELP PROMOTE DEEP TIER SUPPLIER FINANCING', 'text': "LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITIGROUP INC. (NYSE: C) CITI HAS ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS STARTED WORKING WITH STENN, A GLOBAL PLATFORM PROVIDING SME FUNDING, AS PART OF THE EXPANSION OF ITS GLOBAL TRADE PAYABLES FINANCE PRODUCT SUITE TO INCLUDE DEEP-TIER SUPPLIER FINANCING; HELPING TO PROVIDE ACCESS TO FUNDING ACROSS GLOBAL SUPPLY CHAINS. STENN'S ONLINE PLATFORM PROVIDES SMES WITH FINANCING OPPORTUNITIES TO HELP SUPPORT THEIR INTERNATIONAL TRADE. THE OFFERING WILL COVER ONBOARDING, COMPLIANCE, RISK MAN"}